            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Yeh Unit 9 (Division of Polynomials) ke poore unit se practice MCQs hain, unit ke sections ki tarteeb mein. Har sawal ka aik sahi jawab hai aur saath mukhtasar wajah, jis mein hal ke qadam diye gaye hain."
