          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "9.1 Polynomial Function"
          },
          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "question",
            "prompt": "1 The degree of the polynomial \\(4x^{5} - 3x^{2} + 7\\) is:\n(Polynomial \\(4x^{5} - 3x^{2} + 7\\) ki degree kya hai?)",
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "a",
                "text": "\\(5\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "b",
                "text": "\\(4\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "c",
                "text": "\\(2\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "d",
                "text": "\\(7\\)"
              }
            ],
            "answer_id": "a",
            "explanation": "Degree \\(x\\) ki sab se bari power hai: \\(5\\). (4 coefficient hai, degree nahin.)",
            "book_ref": {
              "topic_id": "a5a377ae-2e8e-56de-9d7f-0331f52ed3fc",
              "quote": "is called the degree of the polynomial"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "question",
            "prompt": "2 Which one of the following is a polynomial in \\(x\\)?\n(In mein se kaun sa \\(x\\) mein polynomial hai?)",
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "a",
                "text": "\\(x^{-2} + 1\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "b",
                "text": "\\(x^{3} - 2x + 1\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "c",
                "text": "\\(\\sqrt{x} + 3\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "d",
                "text": "\\(\\dfrac{1}{x} + x\\)"
              }
            ],
            "answer_id": "b",
            "explanation": "Polynomial mein \\(x\\) ki har power non-negative integer (0, 1, 2, ...) honi chahiye; \\(x^{-2}\\), \\(\\sqrt{x}\\), \\(\\frac{1}{x}\\) ki ijazat nahin.",
            "book_ref": {
              "topic_id": "a5a377ae-2e8e-56de-9d7f-0331f52ed3fc",
              "quote": "is a non-negative integer and the coefficients"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "question",
            "prompt": "3 When \\(f(x)\\) is divided by \\(x - 3\\), the quotient is \\(x^{2} + 1\\) and the remainder is \\(4\\). Then \\(f(x)\\) is:\n(\\(f(x)\\) ko \\(x - 3\\) se taqseem karne par quotient \\(x^{2} + 1\\) aur remainder \\(4\\) hai. \\(f(x)\\) kya hai?)",
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "a",
                "text": "\\(x^{3} - 3x^{2} + x - 7\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "b",
                "text": "\\(x^{3} + 3x^{2} + x + 1\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "c",
                "text": "\\(x^{3} - 3x^{2} + x + 1\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "d",
                "text": "\\(x^{3} - 3x^{2} + 4\\)"
              }
            ],
            "answer_id": "c",
            "explanation": "Dividend = Divisor \\(\\times\\) Quotient + Remainder: \\((x - 3)(x^{2} + 1) + 4 = x^{3} - 3x^{2} + x + 1\\).",
            "book_ref": {
              "topic_id": "a5a377ae-2e8e-56de-9d7f-0331f52ed3fc",
              "quote": "This unit studies the division of one polynomial by another to find the quotient and the remainder."
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "question",
            "prompt": "4 When a polynomial is divided by a linear polynomial \\(x - a\\), the remainder is:\n(Polynomial ko linear polynomial \\(x - a\\) se taqseem karne par remainder kaisa hota hai?)",
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "a",
                "text": "linear polynomial"
              },
              {
                "id": "b",
                "text": "hamesha zero"
              },
              {
                "id": "c",
                "text": "quadratic polynomial"
              },
              {
                "id": "d",
                "text": "constant"
              }
            ],
            "answer_id": "d",
            "explanation": "Remainder ki degree divisor ki degree (1) se kam honi chahiye, yani 0: remainder constant hai.",
            "book_ref": {
              "topic_id": "a5a377ae-2e8e-56de-9d7f-0331f52ed3fc",
              "quote": "This unit studies the division of one polynomial by another to find the quotient and the remainder."
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "question",
            "prompt": "5 The quotient when \\(x^{2} + 5x + 7\\) is divided by \\(x + 2\\) is:\n(\\(x^{2} + 5x + 7\\) ko \\(x + 2\\) se taqseem karne par quotient kya hai?)",
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "a",
                "text": "\\(x + 7\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "b",
                "text": "\\(x + 3\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "c",
                "text": "\\(x - 3\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "d",
                "text": "\\(x + 5\\)"
              }
            ],
            "answer_id": "b",
            "explanation": "\\((x + 2)(x + 3) = x^{2} + 5x + 6\\); quotient \\(x + 3\\), remainder 1.",
            "book_ref": {
              "topic_id": "a5a377ae-2e8e-56de-9d7f-0331f52ed3fc",
              "quote": "This unit studies the division of one polynomial by another to find the quotient and the remainder."
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "question",
            "prompt": "6 When \\(2x^{3} + x^{2} - 5x + 2\\) is divided by \\(x + 2\\), the quotient is:\n(\\(2x^{3} + x^{2} - 5x + 2\\) ko \\(x + 2\\) se taqseem karne par quotient kya hai?)",
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "a",
                "text": "\\(2x^{2} + 5x + 5\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "b",
                "text": "\\(2x^{2} - 3x - 1\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "c",
                "text": "\\(2x^{2} + 3x + 1\\)"
              },
              {
                "id": "d",
                "text": "\\(2x^{2} - 3x + 1\\)"
              }
            ],
            "answer_id": "d",
            "explanation": "Wapas zarb dene se \\((x + 2)(2x^{2} - 3x + 1) = 2x^{3} + x^{2} - 5x + 2\\); quotient \\(2x^{2} - 3x + 1\\), remainder 0.",
            "book_ref": {
              "topic_id": "a5a377ae-2e8e-56de-9d7f-0331f52ed3fc",
              "quote": "This unit studies the division of one polynomial by another to find the quotient and the remainder."
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "question",
            "prompt": "7 When \\(x^{3} + 2x^{2} + 3x + 4\\) is divided by \\(x^{2} + 1\\), the remainder is:\n(\\(x^{3} + 2x^{2} + 3x + 4\\) ko \\(x^{2} + 1\\) se taqseem karne par remainder kya hai?)",
            "options": [
